# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor "
"authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the "
"administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an "
"IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge"
" earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification "
"from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal "
"information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and "
"operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with "
"IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner "
"consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be "
"viewed [here.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
msgstr ""
"PAALALA: Gumagamit ang IBM ng mga serbisyo ng Credly, isang third-party na "
"data processor na awtorisado ng IBM at matatagpuan sa United States, para "
"tumulong sa pamamahala ng IBM Digital Badge program. Para maibigay sa iyo "
"ang IBM Digital Badge, ang iyong personal na impormasyon (pangalan, email "
"address, at badge na natanggap) ay ibabahagi sa Credly. Makakatanggap ka ng "
"email notification mula sa Credly na may mga instruksyon para ma-claim ang "
"badge. Ginagamit ang iyong personal na impormasyon para maibigay ang iyong "
"badge at para sa pag-uulat ng programa at mga layuning operasyonal. Maaaring"
" ibahagi ng IBM ang nakolektang personal na impormasyon sa mga subsidiary ng"
" IBM at sa mga third party sa buong mundo. Pangangasiwaan ito alinsunod sa "
"mga kaugalian sa privacy ng IBM. Maaaring tingnan ang IBM Privacy Statement "
"[dito.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
